'''Battle Cats Officers' Club''' (sometimes referred to as the '''Officers' Club''') is a feature added in the [[Version 8.0 Update]] that shows your account's statistics such as [[User Rank]], [[Meow Medals]], [[Underground Labyrinth]] medals, [[Catclaw Championships]] rank, and the numbers of [[Enemy Units|enemies]] and [[Cat Units|units]] that have been discovered. Your Battle Cats Officers' Club card can be viewed at any time by pressing the Menu button in the [[Cat Base Menu]], then selecting Battle Cats Officers' Club. [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] granted players the ability to change the profile picture on the card to any one of the characters you have obtained by simply pressing on the cat icon. You can choose any cat with any form that you have.

==Gold Pass==
By viewing the premium Officers' Club membership, PONOS will offer you a 30-day free trial. Adding a payment type is not required, and accepting will instantly apply the benefits.

The premium membership is 9.99 USD per month (price varies by region), but the first time is free. The bonuses given by the Gold Pass include 1 [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Ticket]] and up to 600 [[Cat Food]] from Gold Card Login Stamps. (30 cat food each day you login for 20 days) Your Officers' Club card will also be displayed as a Gold Pass, and renewing the Gold Pass, gives you the benefit of reducing the number of Cat CPUs needed to use the Gold CPU from 2 to 1.

