==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]], the special benefit for Gold Pass users was the ability to use infinite standard Speed Ups and access to a 3x Speed Up just by spending 1 Speed Up. This was changed once this very benefit became accessible for all customers, regardless of if they owned the Gold Pass or not, leading to the benefit being changed to the one that halves Cat CPU costs for using the Gold Cat CPU.

